        "Final Rubric: [13r2] āryyaga[13r3]ṇapatihṛdayaṃ parisamāptaḥ || || ❈ ||",
        "Rubric: [13r3] oṃ namo bhagavatyai āryyaṣṇī[13r4]ṣav 〚 ī 〛 \\ i / jayāyai ḥ ||",
        "Final Rubric: [17r3] || || āryyaṣṇī[17r4]ṣavijayā nāma dhāraṇī samāpta || || ❈ ||",
        "Rubric: [17r4] oṃ namo bhagavatya āryyapannaśavarītārāyai || namo ratnatrayāya || namo amitābhāya taṃ ||",
