              "witnessLabel": "skt (reconstructed from Kg gzuṅs ’dus e 273b4–276a1)",
              "text": "tadyathā | nimini nimini nimini niminadhare | trilokālokakari triśūlapāṇi sarvavidyudbhayebhyo rakṣa rakṣa māṃ svāhā"
