              "witnessLabel": "skt (reconstructed from Kg gzuṅs ’dus e 273b4–276a1)",
              "text": "tadyathā | nivāraṇi bandha bandha madanadhe mati mati tiṭi gauri gandhāri caṇḍāli mātaṅgi varālini hīnamadhyamadhāraṇi mālini dalamatte cakravakri śabari śabari svāhā"
