              "lang": "Tibetan",
              "witnessLabel": "Tibetan Witness 23",
              "text": "bcom ldan ’das kyis de skad ces bka’ stsal nas | tshe daṅ ldan pa śa ra dwa ti’i bu daṅ | byaṅ chub sems dpa’ sems dpa’ chen po ’phags pa spyan ras gzigs dbaṅ phyug daṅ | (146a1) thams cad daṅ ldan pa’i ’khor de daṅ | lha daṅ | mi daṅ | lha ma yin daṅ | dri zar bcas pa’i ’jig rten yi raṅs te | bcom ldan ’das kyis gsuṅs pa la mṅon par bstod do ||"
