              "lang": "Tibetan",
              "witnessLabel": "Tibetan Witness 24",
              "text": "bcom ldan ’das ma śes rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa’i sñiṅ po źes bya ba theg pa chen po’i (2) mdo rdzogs so || ||"
