              "text": "rgya gar gyi mkhan po bi ma la mi tra daṅ | lotstsha ba dge sloṅ rin chen sdes bsgyur ciṅ | źu chen gyi lotstsha ba dge blo daṅ nam mkha’ la sogs pas źus te gtan la phab pa || ||"
