      "definition": "sGra sbyor bam po gñis pa (Madhyavyutpatti): tantra źes bya ba tantraprabandhākhyā źes ’byuṅ ste | sṅags kyi rgyud źi ba daṅ rgyas pa la sogs pa rgyun chags par (3)bśad pa’i miṅ ste sṅags kyi rgyud ces bya |",
