      "definition": "sGra sbyor bam po gñis pa (Madhyavyutpatti): mantra źes bya ba mantre guptibhāṣaṇe źes ’byuṅ ste | sṅags kyi lha la sogs pa dgug ciṅ gsaṅ ste brjod pa yin pas na gsaṅ sṅags źes bya |",
