      "sanskritTitleIast": "ārya-aparimitāyurjñāna-nāma-mahāyānasūtra (āryā pa ri mi tā yurjñā na hṛdaya nāma dhāraṇī)",
      "bodSkadDuEwts": "62a7(gzungs): 'phags pa tshe dang ye shes dpag tu med pa'i snying po zhes bya ba'i gzungs",
