      "extractedMantraEwts": "Ta ni/ sarba pA pa ni/ bud+d+ha a d+hiSh+ThA ni na swA hA/ 'phags pa rgyal ba'i bla ma'i gzungs rdzogs so// @#/ /rgya gar skad du/ b+ha ga bA na a mi tA b+ha d+hA ra NI man+t+ra/ bod skad du/ bcom ldan 'das snang ba mtha' mi ta ga ga na kIrti ka re sarba kle shak+Sha yaM ka ri swA hA/ gzungs 'di'i yon tan ni bskal pa brgya stong du bsags pa'i las kyi sgrib pa yang 'di lan gsum bzlas brjod byas na sgrib pa de rnams zad par 'gyur ro/ /lan nyi shu rtsa gcig bzlas na rtsa ba bzhi'i ltung du hi ke swA hA/ lus la nad byung ba'am/ nad khong skams su gyur kyang rung ste/ lan nyi shu rtsa gcig bsngags te/ bsil yab kyis de la g.yabs na nad med par 'gyur ro/ /gzungs sngags de gsungs ma thag tu 'khor thams cad yi rangs te/",
