      "folioLine": "123a2(gzungs)",
      "rgyaGarSkadDuEwts": "Ar+ya sarba ta thA ga ta a d+hiSh+ThA na hr-i da ya gu h+ya d+hA tu ka raN+Da nA ma d+hA ra NI ma hA yA na sU tra",
      "sanskritTitleIast": "ārya-aṣṭamaṇḍalaka-nāma-mahāyānasūtra (ārya sarva tathāgata a dhiṣṭhā na hṛdaya gu hya dhā tu ka raṇḍa nāma dhāraṇī mahā yā na sūtra)",
      "bodSkadDuEwts": "'phags pa de bzhin gshegs pa thams cad kyi byin gyis brlabs kyi snying po gsang ba ring bsrel gyi za ma tog ces bya ba'i gzungs theg pa chen po'i mdo",
      "tibetanTitleUnicode": "འཕགས་པ དེ་བཞིན་གཤེགས་པ thams cad kyi byin gyis brlabs kyi སྙིང་པོ gsang ba ring bsrel gyi za ma tog ces bya ba'i གཟུངས ཐེག་པ་ཆེན་པོའི་མདོ",
      "extractedMantraEwts": "dag ste/ chos kyi sku dang / longs spyod rdzogs pa'i sku dang / de bzhin du sprul pa'i sku ste/ dus gsum pa thams cad kyi ring bsrel gyi za ma tog gi phyag rgya'i gzungs kyi chos kyi rnam grangs yin no/ /na ma s+t+rai ya d+h+wi kAnAM/ sarba ta thA ga tA nAM/ o~M b+hu bi b+ha bA na ba re ba tsa Tau/ tsu lu tsu lu/ d+ha re d+ha re/ sarba ta thA ga ta/ d+hA tu d+ha re/ pad+ma gar+b+he/ dza ya ba re/ a tsa le/ sma ra ta thA ga ta/ d+har+m+ma tsakra/ pra bar+t+ta na/ badzra bo d+hi maN+Da a laM kA ra/ a laM kr-i te/ sarba ta thA ga ta/ a d+hiSh+Thi te/ bo d+ha ya bo d+ha ya/ bo bud+d+ha/ sarba ta thA ga ta a d+hiSh+Thi te/ d+hA tu gar+b+he swA hA/ sa ma ya a d+hiSh+Thi te swA hA/ sarba ta thA ga ta hr-i da ya/ d+hA tu mu dre swA hA/ su pra tiSh+Thi ta/ stu be ta thA ga ta a d+hiSh+Thi te/ hU~M hU~M swA hA/ o~M sarba ta thA ga ta uSh+NI Sha d+hA tu mu drA Ni/ sarba ta thA ga ta d+harma d+hA tu bi b+hu Shi ta a d+hiSh+Thi te",
      "extractedMantraIast": "namaḥ sarvatathāgatānām | oṃ vipulagarbhe maṇiprabhe tathāgatanidarśane maṇi maṇi suprabhe vimale sāgaragambhīre hūṃ hūṃ jvala jvala buddhavilokite guhyādhiṣṭhitagarbhe svāhā | oṃ maṇivajri hūṃ | oṃ maṇidhari hūṃ phaṭ ||",
      "extractedMantraTibetan": "dag ste།  chos kyi sku dang །  longs spyod rdzogs pa'i sku dang །  de bzhin du sprul pa'i sku ste།  dus gsum pa thams cad kyi ring bsrel gyi za ma tog gi phyag rgya'i གཟུངས kyi chos kyi rnam grangs yin no།  ། na ma s+t+rai ya d+h+wi kAnAM།  sarba ta thA ga tA nAM།  ཨོཾ b+hu bi b+ha bA na ba re ba tsa Tau།  tsu lu tsu lu།  d+ha re d+ha re།  sarba ཏ་ཐཱ་ག་ཏ།  d+hA tu d+ha re།  པདྨ gar+b+he།  dza ya ba re།  a tsa le།  sma ra ཏ་ཐཱ་ག་ཏ།  d+har+m+ma tsakra།  pra bar+t+ta na།  བཛྲ bo d+hi maN+Da a laM kA ra།  a laM kr-i te།  sarba ཏ་ཐཱ་ག་ཏ།  a d+hiSh+Thi te།  bo d+ha ya bo d+ha ya།  bo bud+d+ha།  sarba ཏ་ཐཱ་ག་ཏ a d+hiSh+Thi te།  d+hA tu gar+b+he སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  sa ma ya a d+hiSh+Thi te སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  sarba ཏ་ཐཱ་ག་ཏ hr-i da ya།  d+hA tu mu dre སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  su pra tiSh+Thi ta།  stu be ཏ་ཐཱ་ག་ཏ a d+hiSh+Thi te།  ཧཱུྃ ཧཱུྃ སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  ཨོཾ sarba ཏ་ཐཱ་ག་ཏ uSh+NI Sha d+hA tu mu drA Ni།  sarba ཏ་ཐཱ་ག་ཏ d+harma d+hA tu bi b+hu Shi ta a d+hiSh+Thi te",
