      "extractedMantraEwts": "sdig pa thams cad 'byang zhing 'chi ba'i dus su bde ba nyid du dus byed par 'gyur ro/ /oM shwe ta wa ra bi dza li ne swA hA/ byang chub sems dpa' sems dpa' chen po sgrib pa rnam par sel ba'i snying po 'di nyin lan bdun mtshan lan bdun brjod na las brgyud mar bsags pa'i sdig pa thams cad 'byang zhing 'chi ba'i dus su gnad gcod pa'i sdug bsngal drag po mi 'byung ngo / /bde ba nyid du dus byed par 'gyur ro/ /oM sarba A ba ra Na bi skaM b+hi ne swA hA/ sangs rgyas sras dang bcas pa de dag rnams la bshos gtsang la sogs pa'i mchod pas",
