      "bodSkadDuEwts": "'phags pa sgo bzang po zhes bya ba'i gzungs",
      "tibetanTitleUnicode": "འཕགས་པ sgo bzang po ཞེས་བྱ་བ'i གཟུངས",
      "extractedMantraEwts": "yid la zung shig dang / sgo bzang po zhes bya ba'i chos kyi rnam grangs bshad par bya'o/ /u gu mu gu ba li ni/ ban d+ha ni/ ba la tsa ma na/ ba hu ba hu ba hu li brtA ya swA hA/ de bzhin gshegs pa'i spyi bo nas dbang bskur ba'i gzungs sngags gzhi ban+d+ha ni/ ts+tshin+da ni/ ts+tshin+da ni/ tsi re mi re/ ma he ha da ni/ ba ni ba re/ kha re be re/ bi ri bi ri/ bo d+hi bo d+hi/ su Sha Ni/ sha ra Ni/ ba ru ba ri Ni/ bar hU~M ye/ prah+ma tsA ri Ni/ in+d+ra ba ti/ d+hi d+hi rI ya Ni/ na mo ma he shwa ra ya ni/ r-i shi/ b+hany+dza ni bA ba dza ha ni kA la pa ti ni/ b+hu ta ba da ni/ sat+ya ga the/ so ma bA di/ so ma pra b+he swA hA/ tshe ring bar 'gyur/ tad+ya thA/ ha ra ha ra ha ra hA ni swA hA/ tad+ya thA/ i Di ta ga Di ta/ ba di da/ a ye na/ a ri/ bany+dza ni/ ka kIrta ni/ pu tra da da hA ni/",
