      "extractedMantraEwts": "ya kalbe/ kalbe ni/ ga Ne a nan+ta kalbe/ a mr-i ta kalbe/ hu tA sha re/ a nan+ta mu khe/ a nan+ta tsak+Shu sa mut+ga te/ o~M b+ha swA hA/ rigs kyi bu gzungs kyi gsang sngags 'di dag ni sems can ngan song du 'gro ba rnams kyi don gyi phyir/ sangs na maHsarba bid+yA/ sid+d+h+ya n+tu me man+t+ra pA da swA hA/ 'phags pa 'jigs pa chen po brgyad las sgrol ba zhes bya ba'i gzungs rdzogs // @#/ /'phags pa shes rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa stong phrag brgya pa'i gzungs/ bcom ldan 'das ma yum shes rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa la phyag 'tshal lo/ /tad+ya thA/ o~M mu ni d+harme/ saM gra ha d+harme/ a nu gra ha d+harme/ bi mu k+tid+harme/ sA ra a nu gra ha d+harme/ bai shra ba Na pa ri brta",
      "extractedMantraIast": "ya kalbe | kalbe ni | gaṇe a nanta kalbe | amṛta kalbe | hutā śare | a nanta mukhe | a nanta cakṣu sa mutga te | oṃ bhasvāhā | na maḥsarba bidyā | siddhyantume mantra pāda svāhā | tadya thā | oṃ muni dharme | saṃgraha dharme | anugraha dharme | bimuktidharme | sāra anugraha dharme | baiśrabaṇaparibrta",
