      "extractedMantraEwts": "@#/ /rgya gar skad du/ Ar+ya da sha badzra pA Ni hr-i da ya/ bod skad du/ 'phags pa lag na rdo rje bcu'i snying po/ sangs rgyas dang byang chub sems dpa' thams cad la phyag 'tshal lo/ /'di skad bdag gis thos pa dus gcig na/ bcom ldan 'das mnyan yod rnams grub par gyur cig swA hA/ tad+ya thA/ sa ra sa ra Ne swA hA/ de la lag na rdo rje bcu po de dag gi gsang sngags kyi gzhi rnams ni 'di dag yin te/ tad+ya thA/ u ge te/ ke te/ sa~M ka te/ ud+du le/ d+ha d+he/ ta te/ ta pat+te swA hA/ tsi tse tsi tse/ tsi khe lo ts+tshed ne/ b+hed ni/ sarba bir+ya tshe da ni/ sarba kra ta kA khorda/ pa ra kr-i tanA sha ni/ de la rig sngags kyi rgyal po chen po lag na rdo rje bcu po de dag gi gsang sngags kyi gzhi dam pa ni 'di rnams yin no/ /tad+ya thA/ a le lak+She/ ba ke le la k+She/ a ke/ pa ke/ yak+She swA hA/ tad+ya thA/ hu tu hu tu/ hu tu tu/ bi",
