      "extractedMantraEwts": "byang chub sems dpa' rnams la phyag 'tshal lo/ /brtul zhugs grub pa rnams la phyag 'tshal lo/ /sems can gyi sman pa rnams la phyag 'tshal lo/ /nor bu grub pa rnams la phyag 'tshal lo/ /'di lta ste/ na mo rat+na tra yA ya/ o~M ye d+harmA he tupra b+ha bA he tu na te ShA~M ta bu kha zas la/ /bdun nam nyi shu bzlas nas kyang / /khong du btang na phan par 'gyur/ /de yi bzlas brjod snga ma ste//'di dag rab tu bzlas bar bya/ /na mo rat+na tra yA ya/ o~M ye ng+harmA he tu pra b+ha bA he tu na tA+e NI ta thA ga to h+ya ba datA/ /te ShA ny+tsa ya na rat+na aM gi wang la ni sngags bzlas nas/ /snying po stobs chen 'di bris gdags/ /o~M badzra kro d+ha ma hA ba la ha na da ha pa tsa bi d+h+wan+sa ya dza Ti loM b+ho d+ha ra u ts+tshuSh+ma kro d+ha hU~M phaT swA hA/ /gtsang sbra byas te mgul par gdags/ /de bzhin yungs kar dag la yang / /bzlas",
