      "extractedMantraEwts": "do/ /phur bus gdab bo/ /gnod byed kyi gdon dang / smyo byed rnga zhon gyi gdon dang / grong rgyun la sogs pa'i gdon rnams ni smyo byed gdon du za ba yin pas na shugs sgrol ma'i rig sngags kyis gcad do/ /rig sngags 'chang gi phur bus gdab po/ /o~M a ka ra pra ma ni b+h+yaHphaT/ sha tu ma ki li ki la ya hU~M phaT/ bud med nag mor mngon pa dang / /rnal 'byor spyan rtul byed pa ni/ /sgrol byed nag mo'i gdon yin pas/ /legs ldan dka' thub kyi rig sngags kyis gcad do/ /shugs sgrol ma dbang phyug gtso mo'i phur bus gdab po/ /sarba pra ma ni b+h+yaHphaT/ ro ti ba~M ki li ki la ya hU~M phaT/ skya rims klad pa na ba dang / /rkang lag 'khol ba'i nad byung na 'byung po nag po'i gdon yin pas dpal chen dbang gi rig sngags kyis gcad do/ /shugs sgrol chen mo'i phur bus gdab po/ /dza",
      "extractedMantraIast": "do | phurbusbo | oṃ akarapramani bhyaḥphaṭ | śatumakilikilaya hūṃ phaṭ | sarva pramani bhyaḥphaṭ | tibaṃkilikilaya hūṃ phaṭ | ja",
      "extractedMantraTibetan": "do།  ། phur bus gdab bo།  ། gnod byed kyi gdon dang །  smyo byed rnga zhon gyi gdon dang །  grong rgyun la sogs pa'i gdon rnams ni smyo byed gdon du za ba yin pas na shugs sgrol ma'i རིག་སྔགས kyis gcad do།  ། རིག་སྔགས 'chang gi phur bus gdab po།  ། ཨོཾ a ka ra pra ma ni b+h+yaHཕཊ།  sha tu ma ki li ki la ya ཧཱུྃ ཕཊ།  bud med nag mor mngon pa dang །  ། rnal 'byor spyan rtul byed pa ni།  ། sgrol byed nag mo'i gdon yin pas།  ། legs ldan dka' thub kyi རིག་སྔགས kyis gcad do།  ། shugs sgrol ma dbang phyug gtso mo'i phur bus gdab po།  ། sarba pra ma ni b+h+yaHཕཊ།  ro ti ba~M ki li ki la ya ཧཱུྃ ཕཊ།  skya rims klad pa na ba dang །  ། rkang lag 'khol ba'i nad byung na 'byung po nag po'i gdon yin pas dpal chen dbang gi རིག་སྔགས kyis gcad do།  ། shugs sgrol chen mo'i phur bus gdab po།  ། dza",
