      "extractedMantraIast": "tadya thā | oṃ patākramasi | barākramasi | udayamasi | nairamasi | arkka masi | markka masi | urmamasi | phanamasi | gulmamasi | cībaramasi | mahācīmasi | anta radhaṃ namasisvāhā | namo ratna trayāya | tadya thā | oṃ ālo | tālo | kālo | saccha losama",
