      "rgyaGarSkadDuEwts": "Ar+ya par+N+Na sha ba ri d+hA ra NI",
      "sanskritTitleIast": "ārya parṇṇa śa ba ri dhāraṇī",
      "bodSkadDuEwts": "",
      "tibetanTitleUnicode": "ཨཱརྱ par+N+Na sha ba ri དྷཱ་ར་ཎཱི",
      "extractedMantraEwts": "yongs su bskyang ba dang / yongs su gzung ba dang / zhi ba dang bde legs su 'gyur ba dang / chad pa spang ba dang / mtshon cha sdang ba dang / dug gzhil ba dang / dug gsad pa dang / mtshams gcad pa dang / sa bcing bgyis shig /tad+ya thA/ oM a mr-i te/ A shwa ste/ A shwa sta d+ge/ mA ma ra mA ma ra/ pra sha ma/ u ba sha ma/ dun nu pi dun nu/ du le du ma le swA hA/ na ma sarba sha ba rA NAM na mo ma hA sha pa rA NAM/ oM bi shA tsi bar+N+Na sha ba ri/ bi shA tse swA hA/ oM par+N+Na sha ba ri hU~M phaT swA hA/ oM aM ku re/ maM ku re/ par+N+Na sha ba ri ye swA hA/ oM bi shA tsi par+N+Na sha ba ri/ sarba mA ri pra sha ma ni/ sarba duSh+ThA nA na/ ban+d+ha mu khe/ sarba mu khe hU~M phaT swA hA/ 'phags ma ri khrod lo ma gyon pa'i gzungs rdzogs so// //",
      "extractedMantraIast": "chadpaspaṅba | tadya thā | oṃ amṛte | āśva | āśvastadge | māmara māmara | praśama | ubaśama | dunnupidunnu | duledumalesvāhā | nama sarva śabarāṇāṃnamomahāśaparāṇāṃ | oṃ biśāci barṇṇa śabari | biśācesvāhā | oṃ parṇṇa śabari hūṃ phaṭ svāhā | oṃ aṃkure | maṃkure | parṇṇa śabariyesvāhā | oṃ biśāci parṇṇa śabari | sarva māri praśama ni | sarva duṣṭhā nāna | bandha mukhe | sarva mukhe hūṃ phaṭ svāhā",
      "extractedMantraTibetan": "yongs su bskyang ba dang །  yongs su gzung ba dang །  zhi ba dang bde legs su 'gyur ba dang །  chad pa spang ba dang །  mtshon cha sdang ba dang །  dug gzhil ba dang །  dug gsad pa dang །  mtshams gcad pa dang །  sa bcing bgyis shig ། tad+ya thA།  ཨོཾ a mr-i te།  A shwa ste།  A shwa sta d+ge།  mA ma ra mA ma ra།  pra sha ma།  u ba sha ma།  dun nu pi dun nu།  du le du ma le སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  na ma sarba sha ba rA NAM ན་མོ མ་ཧཱ sha pa rA NAM།  ཨོཾ bi shA tsi bar+N+Na sha ba ri།  bi shA tse སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  ཨོཾ par+N+Na sha ba ri ཧཱུྃ ཕཊ སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  ཨོཾ aM ku re།  maM ku re།  par+N+Na sha ba ri ye སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  ཨོཾ bi shA tsi par+N+Na sha ba ri།  sarba mA ri pra sha ma ni།  sarba duSh+ThA nA na།  ban+d+ha mu khe།  sarba mu khe ཧཱུྃ ཕཊ སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  'phags ma ri khrod lo ma gyon pa'i གཟུངས rdzogs so།  །",
