      "folioLine": "150a4(gzungs)",
      "rgyaGarSkadDuEwts": "Ar+ya gra ha mA hr-i kA nA ma d+hA ra NI",
      "sanskritTitleIast": "ārya-sarvadharmamātṛkā-nāma-dhāraṇī (ārya gra ha mā hṛ kā nāma dhāraṇī)",
      "bodSkadDuEwts": "'phags 150a5(gzungs): ma gza' rnams kyi yum zhes bya ba'i gzungs",
      "tibetanTitleUnicode": "'phags 150a5(གཟུངས): ma gza' rnams kyi yum ཞེས་བྱ་བ'i གཟུངས",
      "extractedMantraEwts": "gnyis pa la sgo bzhis mdzes pa rim pa bzhin du byas pa la pad+ma rgyas pa'i steng du lha nyi ma bsam par bya ba ni lus gzi brjid kyi phung po li khri nye bar 'bar ba lta bu nyi ma stong dang mtshungs ba'i 'od zer can no/ /oM mai g+holkA ya swA hA/ shar du zla ba dkar bo/ oM shi tAM sha be swA hA/ me'i mtshams su mig dmar po/ oM rak+tAM ga ku mA rA ya swA hA/ gshin rje'i phyogs su rgyal rigs gza' lhag mdog ser po/ oM bu d+hA ya swA hA/ bden bral du phur bu dmar ser/ oM braM ha spa ha ye swA hA/ nub kyi phyogs su ba ba sangs dkar po/ oM a su rot+ta mA ya swA hA/ rlung du spen pa mig sman ltar shin tu gnag pa/ oM kr-iSh+Na war+N+N+la ya swA hA/ lus ngan po'i phyogs su sgra gcan dmar nag /oM a mr-i ta pri yA ya swA hA/ dbang ldan gyi mtshams su",
      "extractedMantraIast": "oṃ mai gholkā yasvāhā | oṃ śitāṃśabesvāhā | oṃ raktāṃ gakumārāyasvāhā | oṃ budhāya svāhā | oṃ braṃhaspahayesvāhā | oṃ asu rotta māya svāhā | oṃ kṛṣṇa varṇṇla yasvāhā | oṃ amṛta priyāya svāhā",
      "extractedMantraTibetan": "gnyis pa la sgo bzhis mdzes pa rim pa bzhin du byas pa la པདྨ rgyas pa'i steng du lha nyi ma bsam par bya ba ni lus gzi brjid kyi phung po li khri nye bar 'bar ba lta bu nyi ma stong dang mtshungs ba'i 'od zer can no།  ། ཨོཾ mai g+holkA ya སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  shar du zla ba dkar bo།  ཨོཾ shi tAM sha be སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  me'i mtshams su mig dmar po།  ཨོཾ rak+tAM ga ku mA rA ya སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  gshin rje'i phyogs su rgyal rigs gza' lhag mdog ser po།  ཨོཾ bu d+hA ya སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  bden bral du phur bu dmar ser།  ཨོཾ braM ha spa ha ye སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  nub kyi phyogs su ba ba sangs dkar po།  ཨོཾ a su rot+ta mA ya སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  rlung du spen pa mig sman ltar shin tu gnag pa།  ཨོཾ kr-iSh+Na war+N+N+la ya སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  lus ngan po'i phyogs su sgra gcan dmar nag ། ཨོཾ a mr-i ta pri yA ya སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  dbang ldan gyi mtshams su",
