      "extractedMantraEwts": "pa 'di zung shig / tad+ya thA/ dza ye dza ye dza ye/ ma hA dza ya bA ti ye/ bud+d+ha a d+hi Sh+Thi te/ d+harma a ba b+hA sa ni/ bud+d+ha ad+hi ga me dz+nyA na a ba b+hA se swA hA/ lag na rdo rje 'di dag ni de bzhin gshegs pas spyi bo nas dbang bskur ba'i gsang sngags kyi gzhi ni/ stam+b+hi ta/ sarba a hi tiSh+Thi NAM/ na mo b+ha ga ba ti/ bud+d+ha s+ya/ ma hA ga ru NAM/ bi ha ri ni/ sid+d+h+yan+tu man+dza pa dA swA hA/ de nas bcom ldan 'das la gsang ba ba'i bdag po lag na rdo rjes 'di skad ces gsol to/ / bcom ldan 'das sangs rgyas kyi mthu dang / sangs rgyas kyis byin gyis brlabs kyis bdag gis rig sngags kyi rgyal mo rgyal ba can 'di'i gzungs kyi gsang sngags kyi gzhi rnams brjod par bgyi'o/ /tad+ya thA/ dza ya dza ya dza ya/ phaT phaT phaT/ dz+wa",
