      "extractedMantraEwts": "ban+d+ha mo tsa ni swA hA/ 'phags pa'i sngags de bzlas brjod byas na bcings pa las grol bar byed do/ /bcings pa las grol ba'i gzungs rdzogs // @#/ /rgya gar skad du/ a gra bid+yA man+t+ra/ bod skad tA nAM/ tad+ya thA/ oM shad+khi ni de bi/ A gats+tsha A gats+tsha/ tiSh+Sha d+ha ne/ d+ha na dza ye/ brI brI/ br-id+d+h+ri ka ri/ d+h+ri d+h+ri/ d+h+r-i ti ka rI nA na/ bi bid+yA/ be sha bsta/ A yur+d+ha ra Ni yu yu/ A yuSh+pA la ni/ ta thA ga tA smrar bo d+hi tsit+ta/ ma tI laM bo da ra/ de hi me ba ra na shad+khi ni swA hA/ bdag dge ba 'di nyid kyis sprul pa'i sku 'di nyid du mthong bar gyur cig /stong pa nyid la bzod pa thob par gyur cig /stong ba nyid kyi don mthong bar gyur cig /stong ba nyid kyi don byed par gyur",
      "extractedMantraIast": "bandha mocanisvāhā | agra bidyā mantra | tadya thā | oṃ śadkhi nidebi | ā gaccha ā gaccha | tiṣṣa dhane | dhana jaye | brī brī | bṛddhri kari | dhri dhri | dhṛtikarīnāna | bi bidyā | beśa | ā yurdha raṇiyuyu | ā yuṣpā lani | tathāgatā smrarbodhi citta | matīlaṃbodara | dehimebarana śadkhi ni svāhā",
      "extractedMantraTibetan": "ban+d+ha mo tsa ni སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  འཕགས་པ'i sngags de bzlas brjod byas na bcings pa las grol bar byed do།  ། bcings pa las grol ba'i གཟུངས rdzogs །  @#།  ། rgya gar skad du།  a gra bid+yA man+t+ra།  bod skad tA nAM།  tad+ya thA།  ཨོཾ shad+khi ni de bi།  A gats+tsha A gats+tsha།  tiSh+Sha d+ha ne།  d+ha na dza ye།  brI brI།  br-id+d+h+ri ka ri།  d+h+ri d+h+ri།  d+h+r-i ti ka rI nA na།  bi bid+yA།  be sha bsta།  A yur+d+ha ra Ni yu yu།  A yuSh+pA la ni།  ta thA ga tA smrar bo d+hi tsit+ta།  ma tI laM bo da ra།  de hi me ba ra na shad+khi ni སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  bdag dge ba 'di nyid kyis sprul pa'i sku 'di nyid du mthong bar gyur cig ། stong pa nyid la bzod pa thob par gyur cig ། stong ba nyid kyi don mthong bar gyur cig ། stong ba nyid kyi don byed par gyur",
