      "rgyaGarSkadDuEwts": "Ar+ya ma hA me g+ha bA ta maN+Dal sarba nA ga hr-i da yaM nA ma ma hA yA na sU tra",
      "sanskritTitleIast": "ārya-mahāmegha (ārya mahā me gha bā ta maṇḍal sarva nā ga hṛ da yaṃ nāma mahā yā na sūtra)",
      "bodSkadDuEwts": "'phags pa sprin chen po rlung gi dkyil 'khor gyi le'u klu thams cad kyi snying po zhes bya ba theg pa chen po'i mdo",
      "tibetanTitleUnicode": "འཕགས་པ sprin chen po rlung gi dkyil 'khor gyi le'u klu thams cad kyi སྙིང་པོ ཞེས་བྱ་བ ཐེག་པ་ཆེན་པོའི་མདོ",
      "extractedMantraEwts": "mu lu mu lu/ tsa Ta tsa Ta/ pa Ta pa Ta/ ma Ta ma Ta swA hA/ glog 'bar ba rab tu phyung zhing / rdzi char chen po'i rgyun thong la char phob cig /kye kye klu chen po dag sangs rgyas kyi bden pa dang / chos kyi bden pa dang / dge 'dun gyi bden pa dran par gyis shig / kye klu chen po dag tshur sheg tshur sheg /'dzam bu'i gling du char rab tu phob shig /gu Tu gu Tu/ mu Du mu Du/ hi hi hi hi/ tsu Da tsu Da/ ma hA nA ga hr-id ya/ sarba nA gA nAM/ A kaD+D+ha ya/ sany+tso da ya/ shrI g+hAn da ra swA hA/ sprin chen po dag tshur tshur tshur sheg tshur sheg / d+hu d+hu d+hu d+hu/ hA hA hA/ hI hI/ hU~M hU~M/ 'brug sgra chen po sgrogs shing / rlung chen po rab tu gtong ba dag sangs rgyas kyi bden pas 'dzam bu'i gling 'dir char rab tu phob cig swA hA/ kye kye klu dang / klu'i rgyal po dag klu",
      "extractedMantraIast": "mulu mulu | caṭa caṭa | paṭa paṭa | maṭa maṭa svāhā | kyechenpodagchurśegchurśeg | guṭu guṭu | muḍu muḍu | hihi hihi | cuḍa cuḍa | mahā nāgahṛdya | sarva nāgānāṃ | ā kaḍḍha ya | sañco daya | śrīghāndarasvāhā | sprinchenpodagchurchurchurśegchurśeg | dhudhu dhudhu | hāhāhā | hī hī | hūṃ hūṃ",
      "extractedMantraTibetan": "mu lu mu lu།  tsa Ta tsa Ta།  pa Ta pa Ta།  ma Ta ma Ta སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  glog 'bar ba rab tu phyung zhing །  rdzi char chen po'i rgyun thong la char phob cig ། kye kye klu chen po dag sangs rgyas kyi bden pa dang །  chos kyi bden pa dang །  dge 'dun gyi bden pa dran par gyis shig །  kye klu chen po dag tshur sheg tshur sheg ། 'dzam bu'i gling du char rab tu phob shig ། gu Tu gu Tu།  mu Du mu Du།  hi hi hi hi།  tsu Da tsu Da།  མ་ཧཱ nA ga hr-id ya།  sarba nA gA nAM།  A kaD+D+ha ya།  sany+tso da ya།  shrI g+hAn da ra སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  sprin chen po dag tshur tshur tshur sheg tshur sheg །  d+hu d+hu d+hu d+hu།  hA hA hA།  hI hI།  ཧཱུྃ ཧཱུྃ།  'brug sgra chen po sgrogs shing །  rlung chen po rab tu gtong ba dag sangs rgyas kyi bden pas 'dzam bu'i gling 'dir char rab tu phob cig སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  kye kye klu dang །  klu'i rgyal po dag klu",
