      "bodSkadDuEwts": "dpal mgon po nag po zhes bya ba'i gzungs",
      "tibetanTitleUnicode": "dpal mgon po nag po ཞེས་བྱ་བ'i གཟུངས",
      "extractedMantraEwts": "ldan 'das bdag gi rig pa 'di 'bul gyis bzhes su gsol/ oM shrI ma hA kA la g+ha Na g+ha Na Ti swA hA/ na maHshrI ma hA kA la ga Ne gu ti shA ya/ na mo yo gi na NI na/ tad+ya thA/ oM hi le hi le/ ki te ki te ni/ tsi de tsi de ni swA hA/ 'di bton pas nad thams cad dang / rA dza d+hU te na/ ba hu shra be/ ba hu pa ri pA ri/ ba hu pa ri sho d+ha ne i maM dzA ra tsaN+Da laM/ ha na ha na/ oM suM b+ha/ ni suM b+ha/ shi ra muny+tsa/ tsak+Shu muny+tsa/ shro tra muny+tsa/ g+h+rA Na muny+tsa/ dzi hwA muny+tsa/ ka Na Tha muny+tsa/ grI ba muny+tsa/ priSh+Tha muny+tsa/ kA Ti kA muny+tsa/ kuk+Sha muny+tsa/ U ru muny+tsa/ dza nau muny+tsa/ hasta muny+tsa/ pA dau muny+tsa/ aM gu li muny+tsa/ i ga pra t+yaM ga muny+tsa/ a ba sa ra/ a n+ya si maM gats+tsha/ dz+wa ra mu to si bdag la swA hA/ oM dz+wa la mA aM gu li hU~M/ sarba dz+wa rA na na phaT/ 'phags pa nag po chen po'i gzungs rims nad thams cad",
      "extractedMantraIast": "oṃ śrīmahākālaghaṇaghaṇaṭisvāhā | na maḥśrī mahākālagaṇegutiśāya | namoyoginaṇīna | tadya thā | oṃ hile hile | kite kite ni | cidecidenisvāhā | rājadhūtena | bahuśrabe | bahu pari pāri | bahu pari śodhane imaṃjāra caṇḍa laṃ | hana hana | oṃ suṃbha | nisuṃbha | śira muñca | cakṣu muñca | śrotra muñca | ghrāṇa muñca | jihvā muñca | kaṇaṭha muñca | grība muñca | priṣṭha muñca | kāṭikā muñca | kukṣa muñca | ūru muñca | janau muñca | hasta muñca | pādau muñca | aṃguli muñca | igapratyaṃga muñca | abasara | añasimaṃ gaccha | jvaramutosilasvāhā | oṃ jvalamā aṃguli hūṃ | sarva jvarānana phaṭ",
      "extractedMantraTibetan": "ldan 'das bdag gi rig pa 'di 'bul gyis bzhes su gsol།  ཨོཾ shrI མ་ཧཱ kA la g+ha Na g+ha Na Ti སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  na maHshrI མ་ཧཱ kA la ga Ne gu ti shA ya།  ན་མོ yo gi na NI na།  tad+ya thA།  ཨོཾ hi le hi le།  ki te ki te ni།  tsi de tsi de ni སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  'di bton pas nad thams cad dang །  rA dza d+hU te na།  ba hu shra be།  ba hu pa ri pA ri།  ba hu pa ri sho d+ha ne i maM dzA ra tsaN+Da laM།  ha na ha na།  ཨོཾ suM b+ha།  ni suM b+ha།  shi ra muny+tsa།  tsak+Shu muny+tsa།  shro tra muny+tsa།  g+h+rA Na muny+tsa།  dzi hwA muny+tsa།  ka Na Tha muny+tsa།  grI ba muny+tsa།  priSh+Tha muny+tsa།  kA Ti kA muny+tsa།  kuk+Sha muny+tsa།  U ru muny+tsa།  dza nau muny+tsa།  hasta muny+tsa།  pA dau muny+tsa།  aM gu li muny+tsa།  i ga pra t+yaM ga muny+tsa།  a ba sa ra།  a n+ya si maM gats+tsha།  dz+wa ra mu to si bdag la སྭཱ་ཧཱ།  ཨོཾ dz+wa la mA aM gu li ཧཱུྃ།  sarba dz+wa rA na na ཕཊ།  འཕགས་པ nag po chen po'i གཟུངས rims nad thams cad",
      "sourceUrl": "http://www.rkts.org/rkts1/data/etexts/1D/101.txt",
