      "extractedMantraEwts": "ro swA hA/ lha mo nag mo chen mo'i gzungs rdzogs // @#/ /rgya gar skad du/ shrI de bI kA lI nA ma A Sh+Ta sha ta ka/ bod skad du/ dpal lha mo nag mo'i mtshan brgya rtsa brgyad pa/ sangs rgyas dam chos 'dzin pa rnams la byams/ /oM AHhU~M/ shrI de bi kA li sa ma ya dzaH/ DA ki nI DA la sa ma ya swA hA/ ming brgya rtsa brgyad gang 'dzin pa/ /yon tan brgya rtsa brgyad kyang 'thob/ /dmyal ba'i sdug bsngal myong mi 'gyur/ /gnas su mi skye shing rta khyod kyi rus/ /lha yul dag tu grags pa yin/ /na mo badzra pA Ni s+ya/ tsi li tsi li/ /b+hin+di b+hin+di/ /muny+tsa muny+tsa muny+tsa ha ba la ka na swA hA/ badzra bA Ni rA dz+nyA pa ya ti swA hA/ /de ba sa mA dz+nyA pa ya ti swA hA/ /r-i Sha yaHsa mAdz+nyA pa ya",
      "extractedMantraIast": "śrīdebīkālīnāma āṣṭaśataka | oṃ āḥhūṃ | śrīdebikālisamayajaḥ | ḍākinī ḍālasamayasvāhā | namo vajra pāṇisya | cili cili | bhindi bhindi | muñca muñca muñca habalakanasvāhā | vajra bāṇirājñāpayatisvāhā | debasamājñāpayatisvāhā | ṛṣa yaḥsa mājñā paya",
