      "category": "Sūtra",
      "totalChars": 15797,
      "diplomaticFolioExcerpt": "National Archives, Kathmandu, Nepal \n\nPratītyasamutpādavyākhyā\nMicrofilm: B 22/20\nSize: 0 x 4 cm x 6  Folios\nMaterial(s): Palm leaf\nScript(s): W\nLanguage: S\nSubject(s): B\nNAK Accession Number: 5/142\n\n[final file input by NIBS center, folios re-ordered as Tucci's edition by Aisha]\n\n\nPratitya Samutpāda Vyākhyā\nB 23-26-000  \n\n\nScanned image no. 013 / Folio __A / Duplicate of scanned image no. 011B\nB 23-26-006\nFolio A\n\rktvā vidhirvijñāyeta | na pūrvakālakriyārthe iti | punaścātrapaścādviniścayaṁ kariṣyāmaḥ | \nca iti | yuṣmabhyaṁ yuṣmānuddīsyeti darśayati | bhikṣava iti āmantraṇaṁ bhikṣūṇāṁ | \nanya cintānānta dutsukhīkaraṇārthaṁ | kasmādbhikṣūṇāmevanānyāsāṁ parṣadāṁ | \nagrandhācchreṣṭhandhā dāsannandhātsadā ca sānnidhyāt grahaṇe ca \nśaktimant",
