      "category": "Sūtra",
      "totalChars": 690453,
      "diplomaticFolioExcerpt": "pṛṣṭha 1\nom namo bhagavatyai ārya prajñāpāramiatāyai || nirvikalpe namastubhyaṁ prajñāpāramiate'mite|yātvaṁ sarvānavadyāṁginiravadyairnirikṣase | ākāśamiva nirlapāṁ niprapañcaṁ nirakṣarāṁ | yastvāṁpaśyati bhāvena sapaśyati tathāgataṁ || tavacārya guṇādyāyā buddhasyaca jagadguroḥ | napasyantyantaraṁ santaścandracandrikayorivaḥ | kṛpātmakā prapadyatvāṁ buddha dharma purassarīṁ | sukhenāyānti mahātmya matulaṁ\nbhaktivatsale | sakṛdapyāsaye śuddheyastvāṁ vidhivadīkṣyate| tenāpi niyataṁsiddhi prāpyate moghadarśane || sarveṣāmapivīrāṇāṁ | parārthe'bhiratātmanāṁ yodhikā janayitrīcamātā tvamasivatsalā | yadbuddhā lokaguruvaḥputrāstava kṛpālavaḥ | tenatvamasi kalyānī sarvasatva pitāmahī | sarvapāramitābhistvaṁ nirmalābhiranindi te | candralekheva tār",
      "normalizedIastExcerpt": "pṛṣṭha om namo bhagavatyai ārya prajñāpāramiatāyai || nirvikalpe namastubhyaṃ prajñāpāramiate'mite|yātvaṃ sarvānavadyāṃginiravadyairnirikṣase | ākāśamiva nirlapāṃ niprapañcaṃ nirakṣarāṃ | yastvāṃpaśyati bhāvena sapaśyati tathāgataṃ || tavacārya guṇādyāyā buddhasyaca jagadguroḥ | napasyantyantaraṃ santaścandracandrikayorivaḥ | kṛpātmakā prapadyatvāṃ buddha dharma purassarīṃ | sukhenāyānti mahātmya matulaṃ bhaktivatsale | sakṛdapyāsaye śuddheyastvāṃ vidhivadīkṣyate| tenāpi niyataṃsiddhi prāpyate moghadarśane || sarveṣāmapivīrāṇāṃ | parārthe'bhiratātmanāṃ yodhikā janayitrīcamātā tvamasivatsalā | yadbuddhā lokaguruvaḥputrāstava kṛpālavaḥ | tenatvamasi kalyānī sarvasatva pitāmahī | sarvapāramitābhistvaṃ nirmalābhiranindi te | candralekheva tār",
