      "id": "nibs_newar_sadaksari",
      "titleDiplomaticNewar": "mānanda māmantrayātisma|| uṅndatva mānanda imāṁ ṣaḍakṣarī mahāvidyā dhārayet paryyavo prūhitatkasya heto iya mānanda",
