      "titleDiplomaticNewar": "ṣpadhūpadīpa gandha yathā vidhinā sarvva dayāt || om āḥ hū̐ phaṭ svāhā || iti saddharmma pāṭhanāma dhāraṇī samāptaṁ || 101 om namaḥ śrī vaja",
