        "aśuddhatattvaṃ māyākhyamindrajālavadudvabhau",
        "p. tatra māyātattvamindrajālabījam | tadabhijño bhagavān māyākandalīkandaḥ śivo malavidāraṇena svayamabhivyanakti | sā hi svayaṃ na satī | yadi satī bhaved māyaiva na syāditi ṣaṭtriṃśattattvasiddhau | tathāhi",
        "māyāvinā na māyāsti vinā māyī śarīravān",
        "puṃsojñakartṛkārthaṃ māyātastattvapañcakaṃ bhavati",
