          "sanskritIast": "atha vā manasāpyanarcayan ityāvaśyakapūjoktiratiṣṭa sravaṇāt | kauśikīdurgā | atra pāṭha krameṇa pūjākramo navoddhavyaḥ | yataḥ pūrvaṃ sūryapūjāśeṣeṇa devapūjeti śiṣṭācāro dṛśyate",
